        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 149823,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Was ist asynchroner Code?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Code, der ausgeführt wird, während das Spiel weiterläuft</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Code, das nur in einer strikten Reihenfolge von oben nach unten ausgeführt wird, ohne zu warten</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Code, das eine Zeile nach der anderen ausführt und niemals pausieren kann</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Code, der ausgeführt wird, während das Spiel weiterläuft.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 149824,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Was beschreibt den folgenden Code am besten?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Starting game setup&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"score += \" /><text value=\"99\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Game setup is complete&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"`Our current score is \" /><text value=\"${score}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"`\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;This log prints last&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Der Code ist synchron</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Der Code ist asynchron</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Es gibt nicht genug Code, um zu einem Schluss zu kommen</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Der Code ist synchron.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 149825,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Was ist eine Callback-Funktion?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Eine Funktion, die wir in eine andere Funktion übergeben und später aufrufen (zum Beispiel, nachdem ein Gegner erscheint)</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Eine spezielle Funktion, die nur einmal in einem Spiel verwendet werden kann</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Eine Funktion, die nur für sich selbst läuft und niemals weitergegeben werden kann</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Eine Funktion, die wir in eine andere Funktion übergeben und später aufrufen (zum Beispiel, nachdem ein Gegner erscheint).</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 149826,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Übergebe die Callback-Funktion an die asynchrone <code>setTimeout</code>-Methode.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"setTimeout\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"118\" endIndex=\"130\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"callbackFunc\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Spawned an enemy later because we're using asynchronous code.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"setTimeout(callbackFunc, \" /><text value=\"1500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Frame 1: game loop continues&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Frame 2: player can still move&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>callbackFunc</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 149827,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Rufe die Callback-Funktion innerhalb von <code>sayHello</code> auf.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"93\" endIndex=\"103\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" showLevelIntro = \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"levelName, callback\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"`Entering: \" /><text value=\"${levelName}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"`\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  callback();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" startLevel = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Level started!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"showLevelIntro(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Forest 1&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", startLevel);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Gib <code>callback()</code> ein.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 149828,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Was macht die <code>setTimeout()</code>-Methode?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Es führt einen Callback einmal nach einer Verzögerung aus (wie das Erscheinen eines Power-Ups nach 2 Sekunden)</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Es führt seinen Callback wiederholt in einem festen Intervall aus</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Es erstellt einen Verzögerungstimer, der eine andere Methode automatisch abbricht</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Es führt einen Callback einmal nach einer Verzögerung aus (wie das Erscheinen eines Power-Ups nach 2 Sekunden).</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 149829,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Was macht die <code>clearInterval()</code>-Methode?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Es stoppt einen wiederholenden Rückruf, der durch <code>setInterval()</code> gestartet wurde (wie das Stoppen eines tickenden Timers)</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Es akzeptiert immer 3 Parameter</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Es funktioniert nur, wenn der Interval-Callback <code>true</code> zurückgibt</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Es stoppt einen wiederholenden Rückruf, der durch <code>setInterval()</code> gestartet wurde (wie das Stoppen eines tickenden Timers).</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 149830,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Was passiert im folgenden Code?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" callback = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Enemy AI tick&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" intervalID = setInterval(callback, \" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"setTimeout(\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" clearInterval(intervalID);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Enemy AI ticks were stopped&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}, \" /><text value=\"1000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Der Callback läuft alle 200 Millisekunden, bis <code>clearInterval()</code> ihn stoppt</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Der Callback läuft einmal nach einer Verzögerung von 200 Millisekunden</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Der Callback läuft alle 1000 Millisekunden, bis <code>clearInterval()</code> ihn stoppt</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Der Callback läuft alle 200 Millisekunden, bis <code>clearInterval()</code> ihn stoppt.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 149831,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Rufe <code>setTimeout()</code> mit der Callback-Funktion und einer Verzögerung von <code>1000</code> Millisekunden auf.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"2000\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"callback\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"62\" endIndex=\"72\" /><option startIndex=\"72\" endIndex=\"73\" /><option startIndex=\"73\" endIndex=\"85\" /><option startIndex=\"86\" endIndex=\"90\" /><option startIndex=\"90\" endIndex=\"91\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"ourCallback\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Power-up spawned!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"setTimeout(ourCallback, \" /><text value=\"1000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Game is running...&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>setTimeout</code>, gefolgt von <code>(</code> und schließlich <code>ourCallback,</code>, <code>1000</code>, <code>)</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 149832,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Rufe die <code>setInterval()</code>-Methode mit der Callback-Funktion und einer Verzögerung von <code>200</code> Millisekunden auf. Speichere sie in der Variable <code>intervalID</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"settimeout\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"intervalID\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"71\" endIndex=\"82\" /><option startIndex=\"83\" endIndex=\"94\" /><option startIndex=\"96\" endIndex=\"99\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ourCallback = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Game tick&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" intervalID = setInterval(ourCallback, \" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"setTimeout(\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" clearInterval(intervalID);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Ticks stopped after 1.2 seconds.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}, \" /><text value=\"1200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>setInterval</code>, gefolgt von <code>ourCallback</code> und schließlich <code>200</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 149833,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Vervollständige die <code>if</code>-Bedingung, um sicherzustellen, dass das Promise aufgelöst wird.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"reject\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"boss\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"288\" endIndex=\"304\" /><option startIndex=\"304\" endIndex=\"312\" /><option startIndex=\"323\" endIndex=\"330\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" levelData = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"forest\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"enemies\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"powerUps\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": [\" /><text value=\"&quot;health&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;shield&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;speed&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" },\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"desert\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"enemies\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"13\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"powerUps\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": [\" /><text value=\"&quot;ammo&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;health&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;map&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" },\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"boss\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"enemies\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"powerUps\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": []\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"loadForestLevel\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Promise\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"resolve, reject\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (levelData.forest.enemies &gt; \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   resolve(\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"&quot;Forest level loaded with enemies. Starting level.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" });\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" startLoad = loadForestLevel();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(startLoad);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>levelData.forest</code>, gefolgt von <code>.enemies</code> und schließlich <code>resolve</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 149834,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Schreibe Code, um sicherzustellen, dass die <code>reject</code>-Funktion immer ausgeführt wird.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"resolve\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"forest\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"286\" endIndex=\"295\" /><option startIndex=\"295\" endIndex=\"296\" /><option startIndex=\"296\" endIndex=\"300\" /><option startIndex=\"300\" endIndex=\"301\" /><option startIndex=\"301\" endIndex=\"308\" /><option startIndex=\"397\" endIndex=\"403\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" levelData = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"forest\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"enemies\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"powerUps\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": [\" /><text value=\"&quot;health&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;shield&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;speed&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" },\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"desert\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"enemies\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"13\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"powerUps\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": [\" /><text value=\"&quot;ammo&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;health&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;map&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" },\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"boss\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"enemies\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"powerUps\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": []\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"loadBossLevel\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Promise\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"resolve, reject\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (levelData.boss.enemies &gt; \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   resolve(\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"&quot;Boss level loaded with enemies. Starting level.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   reject(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Boss level cannot start: no enemies configured.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" });\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" startLoad = loadBossLevel();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(startLoad);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>levelData</code>, gefolgt von <code>.</code> und schließlich <code>boss</code>, <code>.</code>, <code>enemies</code>, <code>reject</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
